Challenge Objective
It is 8:00 AM. You support a busy executive managing multiple businesses.

The Calendar Conflict:
Two high-priority meetings (one with investors, one with a key partner) are scheduled at the same time.

The Inbox Overload:
You have 120+ unread emails, including urgent requests, spam, and unclear priorities.

The Travel Issue:
A flight booked for tomorrow has just been canceled, and the executive must still attend the event.
Your Task
Propose a solution to the calendar conflict, including communication drafts.
Organize the inbox into priority categories and draft responses for 3 key emails.
Provide a revised travel plan with contingencies.
Outline your daily workflow system to prevent overload situations.
Draft a brief executive update summary.
